{"name":"Flesh Bolt","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell001","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You hurl a lance of necrotic power at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 necrotic damage, and you regain hit points equal to one-quarter of the damage dealt.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> 3d8 at 11th level, 4d8 at 20th level.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature","prompt":true},"range":{"value":80,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"rsak","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["2d8","necrotic"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":1,"school":"nec","properties":["vocal","somatic"],"materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":5,"bloodMagicType":"vengeance","pathRestriction":"moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell001","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Gabriel's Trumpet","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell002","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A thunderous horn blast echoes out in a 60-foot cone originating from you. Each creature in the cone must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 1d4 force damage and is taunted until the end of its next turn. On a successful save, the creature is taunted but takes no damage.</p><p>A taunted creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against any target other than you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":60,"width":null,"units":"ft","type":"cone","prompt":true},"range":{"value":"","long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["1d4","force"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":1,"school":"evo","properties":["vocal","somatic"],"materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":10,"bloodMagicType":"vengeance","pathRestriction":"moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell002","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"The Devil's Leverage","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell003","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You channel dark power to enhance your next attack at a cost. Until the end of the turn, your next weapon attack roll has advantage. However, you forfeit your reaction during the following round.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"1","units":"turn"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":"","width":null,"units":"","type":"self","prompt":true},"range":{"value":"","long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":1,"school":"trs","properties":["somatic"],"materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":5,"bloodMagicType":"vengeance","pathRestriction":"moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell003","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Eagleheart","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell004","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A spectral eagle weaves through up to three allies you can see within range. Each ally regains 1d4 + your Chosen modifier hit points. You take 1d10 necrotic damage as the spell draws from your life force.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":3,"width":null,"units":"","type":"ally","prompt":true},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"heal","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["1d4 + @mod","healing"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":1,"school":"con","properties":["vocal","somatic","material"],"materials":{"value":"a feather","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":10,"bloodMagicType":"mercy","pathRestriction":"sun"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell004","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Bloodreign","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell005","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Must be cast outdoors. Crimson clouds gather overhead in a cylinder 20 feet in radius and 20 feet high, centered on a point within range. The area lasts for 4 rounds. Beginning on your next turn and each round thereafter, you may use a bonus action to summon a rain of blood. Every hostile creature in the area must make a Wisdom saving throw, taking 1d6 necrotic damage on a failure, half as much on a success. You heal half the total damage dealt each round.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels:</strong> 2d6 at 11th level, 3d6 at 17th level.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":"Must be outdoors"},"duration":{"value":"4","units":"round"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":20,"width":null,"units":"ft","type":"cylinder","prompt":true},"range":{"value":60,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["1d6","necrotic"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":3,"school":"nec","properties":["vocal","somatic","concentration"],"materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":10,"bloodMagicType":"vengeance","pathRestriction":"moon"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell005","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Absolution","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell006","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A sky-splitter bolt pierces your heart; you suffer 6d10 lightning damage. Each enemy within 30 feet must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, the creature takes force damage equal to half the lightning damage you took, is pushed 20 feet directly away from you, and knocked prone. On a success, the creature takes force damage equal to one-quarter the lightning damage you took with no additional effects.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":"30","width":null,"units":"ft","type":"radius","prompt":true},"range":{"value":"","long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["6d10","lightning"],["floor(@damage/2)","force"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":6,"school":"evo","properties":["vocal","somatic"],"materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":30,"bloodMagicType":"both","pathRestriction":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell006","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
{"name":"Vindicate","type":"spell","_id":"martyrspell007","img":"systems/dnd5e/icons/svg/items/spell.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Only if the sun or moon is visible to you. You invoke final judgment upon foes who have truly harmed you. Choose any number of enemies within 60 feet that have dealt 50 hit points or more damage to you since your last long rest. Each must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, a solar/lunar bolt erases the creature, dropping it to 0 hit points with no death saves. On a success, it instead takes 12d10 radiant or necrotic damage (your choice).</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"Martyr Blood Magic","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":"Sun or moon must be visible"},"duration":{"value":"","units":"inst"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":"","width":null,"units":"","type":"enemy","prompt":true},"range":{"value":60,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":"","prompt":true},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null,"scale":false},"ability":"","actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["12d10","radiant"]],"versatile":"12d10[necrotic]"},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"level":9,"school":"evo","properties":["vocal","somatic"],"materials":{"value":"","consumed":false,"cost":0,"supply":0},"preparation":{"mode":"prepared","prepared":false},"scaling":{"mode":"none","formula":""},"attack":{"bonus":"","flat":false}},"effects":[],"flags":{"dnd5e-martyr-class":{"isBloodMagic":true,"bloodMagicCost":120,"bloodMagicType":"both","pathRestriction":"both"}},"ownership":{"default":0},"_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"3.3.1","coreVersion":"12.331","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"dnd5e-martyr-class.martyr-spells.martyrspell007","duplicateSource":null},"folder":null,"sort":0}
